ANONYMOUS REGIONS — the web page frames <NotificationSettings/> (one GlassPanel with
three border-t groups); reproduced natively in the same data + grouping + order, no
region hidden (ADR-011). Every visible literal resolves from the catalog under the web
key names (the 31 inner keys translation.browserNotifications.* / settings.tab.* /
notificationSounds.* already existed from the web en.json import — re-used verbatim):

  Region 1 — Browser Notifications (BrowserNotificationsPermissionSection)
    • IconBox(bell) + browserNotifications.title + browserNotifications.subtitle
    • four-way permission switch (web useWebPush): unsupported → .unsupported helper;
      notDetermined → "Enable" button (requests OS auth); granted → "Enabled" badge;
      denied → .blocked helper. Every state renders — never a blank region.
    • granted → "Notify me about": browserNotifications.alerts + .exportStatus toggles + .hint
  Region 2 — Browser tab signals (TabSignalsSection)
    • settings.tab.heading + settings.tab.badge + settings.tab.flash toggles + settings.tab.hint
  Region 3 — Notification sounds (NotificationSoundsSection)
    • IconBox(speaker) + notificationSounds.title + .subtitle
    • notificationSounds.master overall toggle + .autoplayHint (while enabled)
    • notificationSounds.categoriesHeading + 7 channel rows (NotificationSoundChannelRow):
      each = category toggle (notificationSounds.category.<raw>) + ghost Test button
      (notificationSounds.test, a11y notificationSounds.testAria "Test %@ sound") that
      previews a system cue; rows dim when the overall gate is off (web opacity-60)
    • notificationSounds.volume slider (0–100 %, disabled when the overall gate is off)
  Page chrome — web PageContainer copyLink → BrowserNotificationsCopyLinkButton
    (common.copyLink.action/.copied/.label, shared TSClipboard seam)

DATA STATES: the manifest declares 0 API data sources (renders from local state), so no
loading/empty/error data-state is required. The permission gate's four states are each
rendered explicitly (no blank region). Defaults mirror the web verbatim: push alerts/
exportStatus on; tab badge/flash on; sound overall off, perCategory {critical,warning,
charge}=on else off, volume 0.6.

